CoWSwapCapability
├── convert
│   ├── requires an adapter self-call
│   ├── validates tokens, amounts and expiry
│   ├── pre-signs an adapter-owned order with the adapter as recipient
│   ├── preserves typed-data hashes and UIDs across order fields and settlement domains
│   ├── leaves balances and allowances unchanged
│   └── replacement invalidates the previous order at its original settlement
├── settlement
│   ├── separate token approval enables relayer transfers from the adapter
│   ├── proceeds return directly to the adapter
│   ├── callbacks cannot change signatures or reenter manage
│   └── invalidated orders cannot spend later funding
└── invalidation and isolation
    ├── requires an adapter self-call and never touches token balances or allowances
    ├── works while a token is paused and after implementation replacement
    └── shared implementation cannot mix adapter orders
